g-ws2085142"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01","text":"《江表傳》曰：皓以張布女為美人，有寵，皓問曰：「汝父所在？」答曰：「賊以殺之。」皓大怒，棒殺之。後思其顏色，使巧工刻木作美人形象，恆置座側。問左右：「布復有女否？」答曰：「布大女適故衛尉馮朝子純。」即奪純妻入宮，大有寵，拜為左夫人，晝夜與夫人房宴，不聽朝政，使尚方以金作華燧、步搖、假髻以千數。令宮人著以相撲，朝成夕敗，輒出更作，工匠因緣偷盜，府藏為空。會夫人死，皓哀愍思念，葬於苑中，大作塚，使工匠刻柏作木人，內塚中以為兵衛，以金銀珍玩之物送葬，不可稱計。已葬之後，皓治喪於內，半年不出。國人見葬太奢麗，皆謂皓已死，所葬者是也。皓舅子何都顏狀似皓，云都代立。臨海太守奚熙信訛言，舉兵欲還誅都，都叔父植時為備海督，擊殺熙，夷三族，訛言乃息，而人心猶疑。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"vzp_xqn_w3p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0011","surface":"女","start":11,"end":12,"kind":"person","person_id":"vzp_xqn_w3p_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"vzp_xqn_w3p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"vzp_xqn_w3p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-050-he:line058-pei02-01:m0087","surface":"大女","start":87,"end":89,"kind":"person","person_id":"vzp_xqn_w3p_B","status":"contextual_provi